      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are right to want to guide her with clear, factual information. You can explain that gender is about how a person feels inside, which is different from the body parts they are born with. It is a personal feeling, and everyone's internal sense of self is valid. Focusing on respect for how others identify is the most important lesson you can teach her.",
