      "content": "You can explain that biological sex refers to the physical characteristics, like chromosomes and anatomy, which are based on biology. Gender, on the other hand, is a social and personal concept about how a person feels and expresses themselves. Emphasize that while biology is real, how people experience their gender is also a real part of who they are.",
